msgid ""
"Earlier versions of ArduPilot did not incorporate the world magnetic model "
"database, and a locations magnetic declination might need to manually "
"entered, or learned through flight. This is not necessary now. In addition, "
"this allows the declination to be continuously updated on long distance "
"flights."
