#: b5293dcde2c742cba93711fbd7a24bc9 f8c26de76f954d44bcfdedd24c897c54
msgid ""
"Also, learning the compass offsets in flight, instead of ground calibration,"
" is an option for vehicles difficult to move in order to calibrate. But is "
"not recommended, since the Large Vehicle MagCal option is now available. See"
" :ref:`common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner` page for details."
msgstr ""
"此外，在飞行中学习罗盘偏移量（而不是地面校准）是难以移动以进行校准的飞行器的一个选项。但不建议使用，因为大型飞行器 MagCal "
"选项现在已可用。有关详细信息，请参阅 :ref:`common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:102
#: 921997d11a93450884f387ae6da67f40 978ab06ac6d348cf9e1484e54fb35869
msgid ""
"CompassMot — compensation for interference from the power wires, ESCs and "
"motors"
msgstr "CompassMot — 补偿电源线、ESC 和电机的干扰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:104
#: ba14edf6ad984bb7b7368fa9123b22fc d4b8a0f85e9b473bb1e934fbf70cf205
msgid ""
"This is recommended for vehicles that have only an internal compass and on "
"vehicles where there is significant interference on the compass from the "
"motors, power wires, etc. CompassMot only works well if you have a "
":ref:`battery current monitor <common-powermodule-landingpage>` because the "
"magnetic interference is linear with current drawn.  It is technically "
"possible to set-up CompassMot using throttle but this is not recommended."
msgstr ""
"建议在仅有内置罗盘的飞行器以及电机、电源线等对罗盘干扰较大的飞行器上使用此功能。CompassMot 仅在您有 :ref:`电池电流监测器 "
"<common-powermodule-landingpage>` 时效果良好，因为磁干扰与电流成线性关系。从技术上讲，可以使用油门设置 "
"CompassMot，但不建议这样做。"

