#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:133
#: 69ca1e4b284e488480f4258bfe7438b9 c40faa52df594ba092c6c79ca2ea058f
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Check the % of interference displayed.  If it is less than 30% then your "
"compass interference is acceptable and you should see good Loiter, RTL and "
"AUTO performance.  If it is 31% ~ 60% then the interference is in the \"grey"
" zone\" where it may be ok (some users are fine, some are not).  If it is "
"higher than 60% you should try moving your autopilot further up and away "
"from the sources of interference or consider purchasing an external compass "
"(or :ref:`GPS+compass module<common-positioning-landing-page>` (some of "
"these))."
msgstr ""
"检查显示的干扰百分比。如果小于 30%，则罗盘干扰可以接受，您应该会看到良好的 Loiter、RTL 和 AUTO 性能。如果为 "
"31%～60%，则干扰处于「灰色地带」，可能没问题（部分用户没问题，部分有问题）。如果高于 "
"60%，您应该尝试将飞控移得更高且远离干扰源，或考虑购买外置罗盘（或 :ref:`GPS+罗盘模块<common-positioning-"
"landing-page>` （其中一些））。"

