#: cb94b61014e8458cad1654a0ee81cee8 cc005c7fb34a4eb5a6d4c1a5c639c2f4
msgid ""
"In the 4.0 and later releases of ArduPilot, an automatic offset learning "
"feature is available. The :ref:`COMPASS_LEARN<COMPASS_LEARN>` parameter "
"determines how this feature works. This is for advanced users and not "
"recommended."
