#: b478120fb4a04735ab4769d5ec1fb129 d9100aa854da4974ad66884d47b1b20c
msgid ""
"If set to 3, the offsets will be learned automatically during flight, be "
"saved, and this parameter reset to 0. Position control modes (Loiter, Auto, "
"etc.) should not be used while the offsets are being learned."
msgstr ""
"如果设置为 3，偏移量将在飞行过程中自动学习，保存后该参数重置为 0。在学习偏移量期间，不应使用位置控制模式（Loiter、Auto 等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-setup-advanced.rst:112
